{
  "rationale": "The plant separates sensing from motion capability. The specifications encode a safe exploration policy with one-shot action states, obstacle-triggered recovery, rare backward escape only for front blockage, and a last-resort full rotation only after repeated front-blocked failures. Action states self-loop on path_clear to preserve intended open-loop pulses, while obstacle events preempt to recovery.",
  "strategy": [
    "Use one sensor plant and one motion plant, then layer policy as deterministic specifications.",
    "Bias toward move_forward in clear space, use directed turns for side/front obstacles, use move_backward only in dedicated front recovery, and reserve full_rotate for a dedicated stuck state after repeated front blockage."
  ],
